flowchart TB
    accTitle: The catalog bot
    accDescr: Every Monday, or when started by hand, the Catalog workflow lists the repositories of the owner with gh, asks every website of a project at dennis-otto.github.io for its German version, and reads the file from which each card reads what its project works with and the screenshot, the logo and the colors of the social preview from which the hub draws its German picture, on the default branch of its repository. .github/mkdocs_project.py --network --fix compares them with projects.toml. When something differs, the bot opens or updates the issue The project catalog is out of date. A difference with one correct edit goes into one pull request from the branch bot/catalog, which the issue names and a person merges; for every other one, a person changes projects.toml and writes the table of the README. When nothing differs, the bot closes the issue and the pull request.

    week(["Every Monday<br>or by hand"])
    repos["gh repo list<br>the repositories of the owner"]
    sites["The website of every project<br>and its folder de/"]
    files["The files of every project<br>that say what it works with<br>and draw its German picture<br>in the colors of its social preview"]
    catalog[("projects.toml")]
    compare[".github/mkdocs_project.py<br>--network --fix"]
    issue["`The issue<br>*The project catalog is out of date*`"]
    pull["The pull request from bot/catalog<br>with the edits with one correct form,<br>as the release app"]
    merge(["A person merges it"])
    fix(["A person changes projects.toml<br>and runs --write"])
    closed["The issue and the pull request close"]

    week --> repos & sites & files
    repos & sites & files & catalog --> compare
    compare -- "something differs" --> issue
    compare -- "one correct edit" --> pull
    pull -- "named in" --> issue
    pull --> merge
    issue -- "all the rest" --> fix
    merge & fix -.-> catalog
    compare -- "nothing differs" --> closed

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class week,repos,sites,compare,pull bot
    class issue,fix,merge person
    class closed done
